  "tagline": "AI needs a new infrastructure layer. We're building it.",
  "description": "Modal is the serverless compute platform for AI and data teams. Developers write Python functions and Modal runs them in the cloud in seconds, scaling from zero to thousands of CPUs or GPUs on demand and charging only for time running. Modal built its own file system, container runtime, scheduler, and container image builder to deliver fast cold starts, elastic low-latency inference, and large-scale sandboxes, serving customers including DoorDash, Ramp, Suno, Cognition, Decagon, Reducto, and Physical Intelligence.",
